export const title = "LINE Messenger Alert";
export const html = "<h1>LINE Messenger Alert</h1>\n      <hr class=\"rule\" />\n\n<div class=\"figure\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--border);background:#fafbfc;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-weight:700;\">&#8251; This feature is available to cloud service subscribers only.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>LINE Alert lets you receive event alerts through LINE Messenger.</p>\n<p>When an event occurs, the event snapshot and event metadata can be sent through LINE Messenger.</p>\n\n<h2>AI Bridge Action Settings</h2>\n<p>An AI Bridge device registered with the cloud can register a \"LINE Messenger\" action handler on any AI application.</p>\n<p>Add a LINE Messenger action from the Action Setting item under each AI app's Event Action Rule settings.</p>\n\n<div class=\"figure\" style=\"max-width:340px;\">\n<div class=\"app-panel\">\n  <div class=\"form-grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns:80px 1fr;\">\n    <span>Action Type</span><select disabled><option>LINE Messenger</option></select>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Setting the action type to LINE reveals the related settings below it.</p>\n\n<p>Enter your LINE Messenger notification token into the Notification Token field on the AI Bridge LINE alert settings page. How to generate a notification token is described in the next section.</p>\n\n<div class=\"figure\" style=\"max-width:460px;\">\n<div class=\"app-panel\">\n  <div class=\"form-grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;font-size:12.5px;\">\n    <span>Notification Token</span><input placeholder=\"Paste the notification token\" disabled>\n    <span>Additional Message</span><input disabled>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<figcaption>LINE Messenger action settings</figcaption>\n</div>\n<div class=\"figure\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--green);background:#fafbfc;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;\">If you don't have a LINE token, you can create one in \"My Page\" via the LINE Notify link on the action settings page.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>If you write a message in <strong>Additional Message</strong>, that message is included whenever an alert is shown in LINE Messenger. This field is optional and doesn't need to be filled in.</p>\n\n<h2>Generating a LINE Messenger Notification Token</h2>\n<p>To set up LINE Messenger alerts, follow the steps below in order:</p>\n<div class=\"figure\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--green);background:#fafbfc;\">\n<ol style=\"margin:0;\">\n<li>Install the LINE app on a mobile device.</li>\n<li>Create a group chat in the LINE app on your mobile device (invite LINE Notify at the recipient-selection step).</li>\n<li>Log into your account on the LINE website and generate a LINE Messenger notification token.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"margin-top:24px;\">Installing the LINE App on a Mobile Device</h3>\n<p>This step must be performed on a mobile device.</p>\n<p>Install the LINE app from the App Store on iOS, or the Play Store on Android.</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"margin-top:24px;\">Creating a Group Chat on a Mobile Device</h3>\n<p>This step must be performed on a mobile device.</p>\n<p>On the mobile device where you want to receive alerts, create a new group chat. When creating the chat, you must invite <strong>LINE Notify</strong> to it.</p>\n<div class=\"figure\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--green);background:#fafbfc;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;\">If LINE Notify doesn't appear in the list for first-time users, follow these steps instead:</p>\n<ol style=\"margin:0;\">\n<li>Create the group chat without adding LINE Notify.</li>\n<li>Complete the \"Generating a LINE Messenger Notification Token\" steps below first.</li>\n<li>After generating the token, add LINE Notify as a participant from the group chat settings.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"margin-top:24px;\">Generating a LINE Messenger Notification Token</h3>\n<p>This step must be performed in a PC web browser.</p>\n<p>Generate a LINE token by visiting the <a href=\"https://notify-bot.line.me/en/\">LINE Notify homepage</a>.</p>\n<p>Selecting the LINE icon on the action settings page takes you to the Notify homepage.</p>\n<p>Log in with the LINE account you want to receive events on.</p>\n<p>Go to <a href=\"https://notify-bot.line.me/my/\">My Page</a> to find the token generation button.</p>\n<p>Select the group chat you created on your mobile device and generate the token.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Enter a token name</strong> &ndash; the name is only used to identify the token, so any suitable name works.</li>\n<li><strong>Select the chat to send alerts to</strong> &ndash; choose the chat you created on your mobile device. If it doesn't appear in the list, wait a moment and refresh the page to update the list.</li>\n<li>Click the <strong>Generate token</strong> button.</li>\n</ol>";
